                                "sense_id": "5688d93a-3c16-34f6-bd8c-4990708b7eaa",
                                "text": "‘I′ll give you something to keep you awake, McFadyen!’ Ape shouted.\nMeat was taken off to the staff room and given the cuts."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "26244f30-18c3-4b3e-ae65-729f21da73fa",
                                "sense_id": "5688d93a-3c16-34f6-bd8c-4990708b7eaa",
                                "text": "He reckons that about 80% of the boys in the school regularly received the cuts from Mr Saunders so he didn′t feel as if he was being unduly picked on."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "654cf2ca-2979-4ad9-bee8-fb8e0fec9cd1",
                                "sense_id": "5688d93a-3c16-34f6-bd8c-4990708b7eaa",
                                "text": "My greatest happiness is that Sebastian is having a good time at school and has never been given the cuts."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
